  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/bb19dbb719c90ef2d0f6e84e46d3c1af714711278662cfee415977ae96ab51ac.png] \n\nGiven equation: 25 ÷ 5 + 15 - 3 × 5 = 45\n\nOption 1) + and -\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 5**__ - 15 + 3 × 5 = 45\n\n⇒ 5 - 15 + __**3 × 5**__ = 45\n\n⇒ **__5__** - 15 + __15__ = 45\n\n⇒ __20__**__ - 15__ **= 45\n\n⇒ 5 = 45\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 25 × 5 + 15 - __**3 ÷ 5**__ = 45\n\n⇒ __**25 × 5**__ + 15 - 0.6 = 45\n\n⇒ __125____** + 15 - 0.6**__ = 45\n\n⇒ 139.4 = 45\n\n**Option 3) ÷ and -**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 25 - 5 + __**15 ÷ 3 × 5**__ = 45\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 5 + __25__ = 45\n\n⇒ __**50 - 5**__ = 45\n\n**⇒ 45 = 45**\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 25 + __**5 ÷ 15**__ - 3 × 5 = 45\n\n⇒ 25 + 0.3 - __**3 × 5**__ = 45\n\n⇒ __**25 + 0.3 - 15**__ = 45\n\n⇒ 10.3 = 45\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷ and -\".**",
